  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: added isbefore → WI-vuton. The 92.6% dead-code candidate rate documented in WI-vuton with --seeds entrypoints is materially caused by this item — non-Python scripts (50 bash, several TS, html, service-worker) are absent from the entrypoint set, so all their callees look unreachable. Re-baseline WI-vuton's FP rate after this lands before triaging WI-vuton's polymorphic-dispatch and lifecycle-method heuristics."  # d36d
